	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"RE/100シリーズにザクII改が登場！",
			"• RE/100シリーズでは初となるPCパーツを使用しない構造を採用。KPS素材により組み立てやすさを追求。",
			"• オリジナルパーツとして通常版の頭部に加え「指揮官用」と「フリッツヘルム」の頭部が付属。",
			"• 細かなパーツに至るまで分割。組み立てるだけで再現度の高い色分けを実現。",
			"• 可動範囲拡大を実現。胸部装甲を斜め前方に引き出せるほか、コクピットブロックは前方に引き出して前屈時の干渉を回避できる。",
			"• 機体各所の武器取り付けラックの展開を再現。",
			"• MMP-80マシンガン、ヒート・ホーク、ハンドグレネードが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Zaku II Kai appears in the RE/100 series!",
			"• The RE/100 series adopts a structure that does not use PC parts for the first time. Pursuing ease of assembly with KPS material.",
			"• In addition to the standard version's head, \"commander's\" and \"Fritzhelm\" heads are included as original parts.",
			"• Split down to the smallest parts. Achieves highly reproducible color coding just by assembling.",
			"• Expanded range of motion. In addition to pulling the chest armor diagonally forward, the cockpit block can be pulled forward to avoid interference when bending forward.",
			"• Reproduce the deployment of weapon mounting racks in various parts of the aircraft.",
			"• Includes MMP-80 machine gun, heat hawk, and hand grenade."
		]
	},
